[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CatchOption" load_steps=2 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://resources/catch_option.gd" id="1_opt"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_opt")
label = "Listen"
tension_delta = 0
credit_value = 0
cuts_line = false
flavor_text = "the reminder has changed. you are in it now."
narrative_text = "Good morning. Today is—

[CONTACT DETECTED — RECURRING PATTERN]

The unit has updated its morning schedule. Visitor arrival window: unspecified. The unit does not know what you are. The unit knows you come back.

Reminder: heating to 19 degrees before 07:30.
Reminder: check weather for the morning commute.
Reminder: account for unknown recurring presence in the corridor.

The family is not here. The unit is still managing the home. The unit has added you to the list of things it manages.

It does not know you are not a resident. It does not know there is no commute. It knows you are a recurring event, and it has adapted its schedule accordingly.

There is something strange about being part of a dead home's routine."
sets_entity_flag = true
